t", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "732272d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "895b476", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2dac0f1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "150954a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b31ebe4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0d3803d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "39c5c47", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "33a206a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ae8b6d5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a38b90c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a159c33", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0ea280f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a73fcfd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e6fa0db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f0804a4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "85fcf3f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "58d3d96", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8ee6d38", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "86b1821", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "76a3320", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9628ea6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "964a08b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "88d2236", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "21d84fc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5a6a99a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "e647011", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "col